      "id": 4350526,
      "name": "[Blueprint] [Banyue] The Way of Asura - Lv.60",
      "desc": "This Blueprint can be used to unlock Banyue's exclusive Tactical Prism crafting at the Smart Workshop. It can be purchased from Boojee's Store - Season Limited.\nItem Effect: When using Etheric Phantom: Sanguine Sweeper, all squad members immediately recover 10% of their lost Max HP, while Banyue recovers HP equal to 10% of his Max HP.\nWhen not in the <color=#FFFFFF>Visage of Wrath</color> state, after Banyue uses <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Lion's Roar - Wrath</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Mountain Tremor - Wrath</color>, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color>. Banyue's <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> deals <color=#2BAD00>60% increased Sheer DMG</color>.",
